      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "The series' influence extends beyond supernatural elements into pure medical horror. Films like <a href=\"/movie/619778\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"619778\">Malignant</a> (2021) and <a href=\"/movie/126277\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"126277\">American Mary</a> (2012) draw from its tradition of finding horror in medical institutions. The Kingdom's approach to body horror, particularly in its infamous birth scene, echoes through works like <a href=\"/movie/21484\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"21484\">Possession</a> (1981) and <a href=\"/movie/393519\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"393519\">Raw</a> (2016), showing how medical expertise can become a source of terror."
      }
